          "id": "p1-1",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "Good morning. What can I do for you?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-2",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "I want to report a theft. I had some things stolen out of my bag yesterday."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-3",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "I’m sorry to hear that. Right, so I’ll need to take a few details. Can I start with your name?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-4",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "Louise Taylor."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-5",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "OK, thank you. And are you resident in the UK?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-6",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "No, I’m actually Canadian. Though my mother was British."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-7",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "And your date of birth?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-8",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "December 14th, 1977."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-9",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "So you’re just visiting this country?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-10",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "That’s right. I come over most summers on business. I’m an interior designer and I come over to buy old furniture, antiques you know. There are some really lovely things around here, but you need to get out to the small towns. I’ve had a really good trip this year, until this happened."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-11",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "OK. So you’ve been here quite a while?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-12",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "Yes, I’m here for two months. I go back next week."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-13",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "So may I ask where you’re staying now?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-14",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "Well at present I’ve got a place at Park Apartments, that’s on King Street. I was staying at the Riverside Apartments on the same street, but the apartment there was only available for six weeks so I had to find another one."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-15",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "OK. And the apartment number?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-16",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "Fifteen."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-17",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "Right. ………………………………………….."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-18",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "Now, I need to take some details of the theft. So you said you had some things stolen out of your bag?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-19",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "That’s right."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-20",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "And were you actually carrying the bag when the theft took place?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-21",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "Yes, I really can’t understand it. I had my backpack on. And I went into a supermarket to buy a few things and when I opened it up my wallet wasn’t there."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-22",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "And what did your wallet have in it?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-23",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "Well, fortunately I don’t keep my credit cards in that wallet - I keep them with my passport in an inside compartment in my backpack. But there was quite a bit of cash there … about £250 sterling, I should think. I withdrew £300 from my account yesterday, but I did a bit of shopping, so I must have already spent about £50 of that."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-24",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "OK."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-25",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "At first I thought, oh I must have left the wallet back in the apartment, but then I realised my phone had gone as well. It was only a week old, and that’s when I realised I’d been robbed. Anyway at least they didn’t take the keys to my rental car."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-26",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "Yes. So you say the theft occurred yesterday?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-27",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "Yes."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-28",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "So that was September the tenth. And do you have any idea at all of where or when the things might possibly have been stolen?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-29",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "Well at first I couldn’t believe it because the bag had been on my back ever since I left the apartment after lunch. It’s just a small backpack, but I generally use it when I’m travelling because it seems safer than a handbag. Anyway, I met up with a friend, and we spent a couple of hours in the museum. But I do remember that as we were leaving there, at about 4 o’clock, a group of young boys ran up to us, and they were really crowding round us, and they were asking us that time it was, then all of a sudden they ran off."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-30",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "Can you remember anything about them?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-31",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "The one who did most of the talking was wearing a T-shirt with a picture of something … let’s see … a tiger."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-32",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "Right. Any idea of how old he might have been?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-33",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "Around twelve years old?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-34",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "And can you remember anything else about his appearance?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-35",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "Not much. He was quite thin …"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-36",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "Colour of hair?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-37",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "I do remember that - he was blond. All the others were dark-haired."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-38",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "And any details of the others?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-39",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "Not really. They came and went so quickly."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-40",
          "speaker": "Officer",
          "text": "Right. So what I’m going to do now is give you a crime reference number so you can contact your insurance company. So this is ten digits: 87954 82361."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-41",
          "speaker": "Louise",
          "text": "Thank you. So should I …"
