          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "Hi, come and take a seat."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-2",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "Thank you."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-3",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "My name’s Carl Rogers and I’m one of the doctors here at the Total Health Clinic. So I understand this is your first visit to the clinic?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-4",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "Yes, it is."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-5",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "OK, well I hope you’ll be very happy with the service you receive here. So if it’s alright with you I’ll take a few details to help me give you the best possible service."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-6",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "Sure."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-7",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "So can I check first of all that we have the correct personal details for you? So your full name is Julie Anne Garcia?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-8",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "That’s correct."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-9",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "Perfect. And can I have a contact phone number?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-10",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "It’s 219 442 9785."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-11",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "OK, and then can I just check that we have the correct date of birth?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-12",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "October tenth, 1992."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-13",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "Oh, I actually have 1991, I’ll just correct that now. Right, so that’s all good. Now I just need just a few more personal details … do you have an occupation, either full-time or part-time?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-14",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "Yes, I work full-time in Esterhazy’s - you know, the restaurant chain. I started off as a waitress there a few years ago and I’m a manager now."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-15",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "Oh I know them, yeah, they’re down on 114th Street, aren’t they?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-16",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "That’s right."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-17",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "Yeah, I’ve been there a few times. I just love their salads."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-18",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "That’s good to hear."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-19",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "Right, so one more thing I need to know before we talk about why you’re here, Julie, and that’s the name of your insurance company."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-20",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "It’s Cawley Life Insurance, that’s C-A-W-L-E-Y."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-21",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "Excellent, thank you so much."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-22",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "Now Julie, let’s look at how we can help you. So tell me a little about what brought you here today."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-23",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "Well, I’ve been getting a pain in my knee, the left one. Not very serious at first, but it’s gotten worse, so I thought I ought to see someone about it."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-24",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "That’s certainly the right decision. So how long have you been aware of this pain? Is it just a few days, or is it longer than that?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-25",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "Longer. It’s been worse for the last couple of days, but it’s three weeks since I first noticed it. It came on quite gradually though, so I kind of ignored it at first."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-26",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "And have you taken any medication yourself, or treated it in anyway?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-27",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "Yeah, I’ve been taking medication to deal with the pain. Tylenol, and that works OK for a few hours. But I don’t like to keep taking it."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-28",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "OK. And what about heat treatment? Have you tried applying heat at all?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-29",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "No, but I have been using ice on it for the last few days."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-30",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "And does that seem to help the pain at all?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-31",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "A little, yes."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-32",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "Good. Now you look as if you’re quite fit normally?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-33",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "I am, yes."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-34",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "So do you do any sport on a regular basis?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-35",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "Yes, I play a lot of tennis. I belong to a club so I go there a lot. I’m quite competitive so I enjoy that side of it as well as the exercise. But I haven’t gone since this started."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-36",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "Sure. And do you do any other types of exercise?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-37",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "Yeah, I sometimes do a little swimming, but usually just when I’m on vacation. But normally I go running a few times a week, maybe three or four times."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-38",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "Hmm. So your legs are getting quite a pounding. But you haven’t had any problems up to now?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-39",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "No, not with my legs. I did have an accident last year when I slipped and hurt my shoulder, but that’s better now."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-40",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "Excellent. And do you have any allergies?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-41",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "No, none that I’m aware of."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-42",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "And do you take any medication on a regular basis?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-43",
          "speaker": "Carl",
          "text": "Well, I take vitamins but that’s all. I’m generally very healthy."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-44",
          "speaker": "Julie",
          "text": "OK, well let’s have a closer look and see what might be causing this problem. If you can just get up …"
