        {
          "id": "p3-20",
          "speaker": "Martin",
          "text": "You’re right."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-21",
          "speaker": "Rosie",
          "text": "The discovery of the mammoth tooth is probably the most dramatic part, but we don’t have that much information, only what we got from the online article. I thought maybe we could get in touch with the researcher who led the team and ask him to tell us a bit more."
