          "id": "p1-1",
          "speaker": "Andrew",
          "text": "Good morning, Clare House Hotel. Andrew speaking. I’m the Events Manager."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-2",
          "speaker": "Sam",
          "text": "Good morning, Andrew. My name’s Samantha. I’m arranging a party for my parents’ fiftieth wedding anniversary, and I’m ringing to ask about hiring a room some time next September. Also my parents and several of the guests will need accommodation."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-3",
          "speaker": "Andrew",
          "text": "OK, I’m sure we can help you with that. Will you be having a sit-down meal or a buffet?"
