          "id": "p2-1",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Hello everyone. I’m Jake Stevens and I’m your rep here at the hotel."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-2",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "I’m sure you’ll all have a great time here. So let me tell you a bit about what’s on offer."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-3",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "I’ll start by telling you about some of the excursions that are available for guests. One thing you have to do while you’re here is go dolphin watching."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-4",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "On our boat trips, we pretty well guarantee you’ll see dolphins - if you don’t you can repeat the trip free of charge. We organise daily trips for just 35 euros."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-5",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Unfortunately there aren’t any places left for this afternoon’s trip, but come and see me to book for later in the week. If you’re energetic, I’d recommend our forest walk."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-6",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "It’s a guided walk of about seven kilometres. There’ll be a stop half way, and you’ll be provided with a drink and sandwiches."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-7",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "There’s some fairly steep climbs up the hills, so you need to be reasonably fit for this one, with good shoes, and bring a waterproof in case it rains. It’s just 25 euros all inclusive, and it’s every Wednesday."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-8",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Then on Thursdays we organise a cycle trip, which will give you all the fun of biking without the effort. We’ll take you and your bike up to the top of Mount Larna, and leave you to bike back - it’s a 700-metre drop in just 20 kilometres so this isn’t really for inexperienced cyclists as you’ll be going pretty fast."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-9",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "And if it’s a clear day, you’ll have fantastic views. On our local craft tour you can find out about the traditional activities in the island."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-10",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "And the best thing about this trip is that it’s completely free. You’ll be taken to a factory where jewellery is made, and also a ceramics centre."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-11",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "If you want, you can buy some of the products but that’s entirely up to you. The trip starts after lunch on Thursday, and you’ll return by 6 pm."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-12",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "If you’re interested in astronomy you may already know that the island’s one of the best places in the world to observe the night sky. We can offer trips to the observatory on Friday for those who are interested."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-13",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "They cost 90 euros per person and you’ll be shown the huge telescopes and have a talk from an expert, who’ll explain all about how they work. Afterwards we’ll head down to Sunset Beach, where you can have a dip in the ocean if you want before we head off back to the hotel."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-14",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Finally, there’s horse riding. This is organised by the Equestrian Centre over near Playa Cortino and it’s a great experience if you’re a keen horseback rider, or even if you’ve never been on a horse before."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-15",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "They take you down to the beach, and you can canter along the sand and through the waves. It costs 35 euros and it’s available every day."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-16",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "So there’s plenty to do in the daytime, but what about night life? Well, the number one attraction’s called ‘Musical Favourites’."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-17",
          "speaker": "",
